      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_18",
      "quote": "Sixteen studies were excluded as per the eligibility criteria derived above. The key reasons for exclusion included the retrospective nature of the studies, studies performed on minors under eighteen, studies where the risk estimates were not reported, nonrandomized trials, and studies not in the English language.",
      "reason": "The manuscript reports exclusions due to outcomes not being reported (\"risk estimates were not reported\") but does not explicitly state exclusions because outcomes were not measured; thus it partially addresses the distinction."
