      "reason": "The synthesis groups are specified and linked to comparisons: studies grouped as methoxyflurane versus placebo/standard-of-care, with outcomes and sample sizes tabulated for each RCT."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_16",
      "quote": "Studies dating from the year 2010 onward. To provide comprehensive and updated findings, the review found it paramount to include the most recently published data on the application of methoxyflurane in clinical and emergency department settings",
